  "title": "Add text to S2L_SUB_LSP items containing the IP.",
  "description": "This follows what's shown for EXPLICIT ROUTE, HOP, etc. Especially useful in the graphical UI in which all layers are collapsed and only the summary is visible.\n\nBefore:\n```\n    S2L SUB LSP:\n        Length: 8\n        Object class: S2L_SUB_LSP object (50)\n        C-Type: IPv4 (1)\n        IPv4 S2L Sub-LSP destination address: 4.4.4.4\n```\n\nAfter:\n```\n    S2L SUB LSP: IPv4 4.4.4.4\n        Length: 8\n        Object class: S2L_SUB_LSP object (50)\n        C-Type: IPv4 (1)\n        IPv4 S2L Sub-LSP destination address: 4.4.4.4\n```",
